    "text": "The proposed model combines Long Short-Term Memory (LSTM) networks and Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN) to address the limitations of existing deep learning models in handling both contextual and local semantic information for sarcasm detection.",
    "topic": "Hybrid LSTM-CNN model for sarcasm detection"
  },
  {
    "text": "Existing deep learning models for sarcasm detection often fail to effectively capture both contextual and local semantic information, leading to lower classification accuracy.",
    "topic": "Limitations of current sarcasm detection models"
  },
  {
    "text": "The LSTM component of the hybrid model is designed to capture long-term dependencies and contextual information in text sequences.",
    "topic": "LSTM's role in capturing context"
  },
  {
    "text": "The CNN component of the hybrid model is used to extract local semantic features from text, complementing the contextual information provided by the LSTM.",
    "topic": "CNN's role in extracting local features"
  },
  {
    "text": "The hybrid LSTM-CNN model is evaluated against existing models and is expected to achieve higher accuracy in detecting sarcasm in text-based data.",
    "topic": "Performance comparison of the hybrid model"
  }
]
